  ('analysis', 'analysis.series.max_concurrent_components', 'exact', 'int', '4', 'Process-lifetime singleton semaphore bounding cross-request concurrency of per-component `ComputeIndicator`/`ExecuteFormula` execution driven by `GetIndicatorSeries` (feature 125, FR-6), so a routinely-visited Symbol page can''t starve the analysis live loop — mirrors `analysis.screener.max_concurrent_formula_evals`. Read once in `AnalysisServicer.__init__` via `int_positive`: a stored ≤ 0 reads as the default 4, so a non-positive value never reaches `asyncio.Semaphore`.', 'xstockstrat-analysis', false, 'services/xstockstrat-analysis/app/handlers/servicer.py:__init__', false),
  ('analysis', 'analysis.snapshot.indicator_timeout_ms', 'exact', 'int', '500', 'Feature 042 — max ms the P&L-pattern consumer waits for indicator values when composing an order snapshot; on timeout it stores a **partial** snapshot with an empty indicators map (FR-6), never aborting order-event capture.', 'xstockstrat-analysis', false, 'services/xstockstrat-analysis/app/engine/pnl_pattern_consumer.py:_compose', false),
