  ('marketdata', 'marketdata.alpaca.feed', 'exact', 'string', 'iex', 'Alpaca market-data feed for bar/quote requests (`iex`/`sip`/`otc`). The free/basic (paper) data plan only permits `iex`; omitting the param defaults Alpaca to SIP, which those plans reject with HTTP 403. Read at startup.', 'xstockstrat-marketdata', false, 'services/xstockstrat-marketdata/cmd/server/main.go:main', false),
