  ('marketdata', 'marketdata.dividends.backfill_lookback_years', 'exact', 'int', '2', 'Fetch-range bound (years back from now) for the Alpaca cash-dividend feed (feature 211). Bounds only how far back dividends are fetched; the T12M yield window itself is fixed at 365 days in code. Matches the service default.', 'xstockstrat-marketdata', false, 'services/xstockstrat-marketdata/internal/service/marketdata_service.go:backfillOneSymbol', false),
