  ('trading', 'trading.order_intent.stale_multiplier', 'exact', 'float', '3', 'Multiplier applied to `max(live trading.broker.timeout_ms, IBKRRequestTimeout)` to derive the PENDING-intent staleness threshold; read live, floor-clamped in code to ≥1.5 so a misconfigured multiplier can never push the threshold below the live broker timeout.', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/order_intent.go:staleThreshold', false),
  ('trading', 'trading.order_intent.sweep_interval_ms', 'exact', 'int', '5000', 'Interval for `StartOrderIntentSweeper`, the proactive reclaim loop that transitions orphaned `PENDING` intents to `UNKNOWN` after an unattended crash (no retry needed). Matches `trading.fill_poller.interval_ms`''s existing default.', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/order_intent.go:StartOrderIntentSweeper', false),
  ('trading', 'trading.position_sync.interval_ms', 'exact', 'float', '300000', 'Interval for the broker position/balance sync poller (`syncPositions`). Read live on every cycle.', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/trading.go:StartPositionSyncPoller', false),
  ('trading', 'trading.reconciliation.grace_ticks', 'exact', 'int', '1', 'Consecutive ticks a mismatch must persist before it''s a real finding (not a benign propagation delay).', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/trading.go:StartReconciliationPoller', false),
  ('trading', 'trading.reconciliation.halted_poll_interval_ms', 'exact', 'float', '300000', 'Cooldown between `reconcileTick` broker polls (`ListOrders`/`GetPositions`) for an **already-halted** account — slower than the ordinary `interval_ms` cadence, since a halted account can''t place new orders regardless (`isAccountHalted` gates `PlaceOrder`/`ReplaceOrder`) and only needs occasional re-observation to notice broker-side drift (e.g. a manual dashboard order). Read live on every cycle; `<= 0` disables the throttle (polls every tick, matching `interval_ms`''s own convention).', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/trading.go:haltedPollInterval', false),
  ('trading', 'trading.reconciliation.interval_ms', 'exact', 'float', '60000', 'Interval for the broker-state-reconciliation poller (`reconcileTick`). Read live on every cycle.', 'xstockstrat-trading', false, 'services/xstockstrat-trading/internal/service/trading.go:StartReconciliationPoller', false),
